# A window that covers the step's outline (docs/LEARNING.md "Getting back";
# docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"): at 800x600 the Colonies window lies over the command
# buttons. Tutorial 3 at step 13 outlines Empire Status: the lesson outlines Colonies' Close
# button in the recovery style and says to close it first (Esc); once it is closed the
# crown button works.
options --tutorial=research-and-construction:13 --open=colonies --layout=800x600 --size=800x600

wait-lesson research-and-construction
assert-step 13
wait-for item:recovery:colonies:close in=lesson
assert-present item:"hint:Close the Colonies window first (Esc)." in=lesson
screenshot lesson-uncover
key Escape
wait-closed colonies
wait-gone item:"recovery:*" in=lesson
assert-absent item:"hint:*" in=lesson
click tag:command:empire-status
wait-window empire-status
wait-step 14
